[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2461.349, "timestamp": "00:41:01", "text": "现在电脑上没有打开这个代码，但我看到了这条"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2464.069, "timestamp": "00:41:04", "text": "消息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2465.589, "timestamp": "00:41:05", "text": "嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2468.069, "timestamp": "00:41:08", "text": "我也不认为这是英"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2472.309, "timestamp": "00:41:12", "text": "伟达驱动程序的问题，因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2474.87, "timestamp": "00:41:14", "text": "使用的是旧版驱动程序，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2480.47, "timestamp": "00:41:20", "text": "就是这个。 我的天，你在干嘛？等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2495.91, "timestamp": "00:41:35", "text": "哦，等等。 他们发布了真正的新"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2498.49, "timestamp": "00:41:38", "text": "版本。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2501.19, "timestamp": "00:41:41", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2502.95, "timestamp": "00:41:42", "text": "好吧，那我就以一美元的价格留着它吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2504.55, "timestamp": "00:41:44", "text": "美好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2508.95, "timestamp": "00:41:48", "text": "所以，既然游戏玩不了，很"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2514.95, "timestamp": "00:41:54", "text": "遗憾，我今天可能不应该做这件事了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2518.069, "timestamp": "00:41:58", "text": "我应该玩什么游戏？ 我玩不了《"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2519.829, "timestamp": "00:41:59", "text": "战地》系列游戏。"}]